<Positioned left="1084" top="672" width="452" height="46"><Container width="452" height="46" alignment="CENTER" color="transparent" borderRadius="8"><Text text="总体 -9.40 pp：26.00% → 16.60%" fontSize="22" fontStyle="BOLD" color="#DC2626" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontFeatures="+tnum=2"></Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="40" top="750" width="990" height="210"><Container width="990" height="210" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="16" border="2 SOLID #0F766E"></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="64" top="766" width="104" height="30"><Container width="104" height="30" alignment="CENTER" color="#0F766E" borderRadius="15"><Text text="主结论" fontSize="18" fontStyle="BOLD" color="#FFFFFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC"></Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="64" top="808"><Text text="两个渠道的转化率都在上升：直接访问 30.00% → 35.00%，推广访问 10.00% → 12.00%。" fontSize="22" color="#0F172A" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontFeatures="+tnum=2"></Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="64" top="836"><Text text="但总体转化率从 26.00% 降到 16.60%（-9.40 pp），分组与总体方向相反。" fontSize="22" color="#0F172A" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontFeatures="+tnum=2"></Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="64" top="864"><Text text="原因在构成：直接访问占比从 80% 降到 20%，访问转向低转化渠道。" fontSize="22" color="#0F172A" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontFeatures="+tnum=2"></Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="64" top="892"><Text text="总体率 = 成交总数 ÷ 访问总数；对渠道比例取平均会得到 +3.50 pp 的相反结论。" fontSize="22" color="#0F172A" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontFeatures="+tnum=2"></Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="64" top="920"><Text text="恒等分解：率效应 +2.60～+4.40 pp，构成效应 -13.80～-12.00 pp，合计 -9.40 pp。" fontSize="20" color="#B45309" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontFeatures="+tnum=2"></Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1050" top="750" width="510" height="210"><Container width="510" height="210" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="16" border="2 SOLID #DC2626"></Container></Positioned>
